    "title": "Learning Technology Systems Administrator",
    "excerpt": "<p>The Office of Data and Innovation is hiring a Learning Technology Systems Administrator to join the CalAcademy Team. In this role, you will play a key role in designing and implementing digital learning technology systems, including the learning management system (LMS), and supporting learner experience across ODI and other agency divisions.&nbsp; Location: ODI staff reside &#8230; <a title=\"Learning Technology Systems Administrator\" class=\"read-more\" href=\"https://live-digital-ca-gov.pantheonsite.io/join-us/learning-technology-systems-administrator/\" aria-label=\"More on Learning Technology Systems Administrator\">Read more</a></p>\n",
